IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `llp-default-terms`

-- Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005, s 14, the First Schedule and the Second Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_llp.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`the big contributor` MEANS Partner WITH
    `capital contributed` IS 900000

`the small contributor` MEANS Partner WITH
    `capital contributed` IS 100000

`a third partner with no capital` MEANS Partner WITH
    `capital contributed` IS 0

`a partner paying a supplier` MEANS Outlay WITH
    `in the ordinary and proper conduct of the business` IS TRUE
    `necessarily done to preserve the business or property` IS FALSE

`a partner paying to repair a burst pipe` MEANS Outlay WITH
    `in the ordinary and proper conduct of the business` IS FALSE
    `necessarily done to preserve the business or property` IS TRUE

`a partner's personal holiday` MEANS Outlay WITH
    `in the ordinary and proper conduct of the business` IS FALSE
    `necessarily done to preserve the business or property` IS FALSE

`a partner running a rival practice` MEANS SideDealing WITH
    `carried on a competing business of the same nature` IS TRUE
    `derived a benefit from an LLP transaction or its property, name or connections` IS FALSE
    `the LLP consented` IS FALSE

`a partner taking a secret commission` MEANS SideDealing WITH
    `carried on a competing business of the same nature` IS FALSE
    `derived a benefit from an LLP transaction or its property, name or connections` IS TRUE
    `the LLP consented` IS FALSE

`a partner running a rival practice with consent` MEANS SideDealing WITH
    `carried on a competing business of the same nature` IS TRUE
    `derived a benefit from an LLP transaction or its property, name or connections` IS FALSE
    `the LLP consented` IS TRUE

`a partner with an unrelated hobby business` MEANS SideDealing WITH
    `carried on a competing business of the same nature` IS FALSE
    `derived a benefit from an LLP transaction or its property, name or connections` IS FALSE
    `the LLP consented` IS FALSE

`a conversion with the same partners` MEANS Conversion WITH
    `the LLP's partners are exactly the firm's partners` IS TRUE

`a conversion adding a new partner` MEANS Conversion WITH
    `the LLP's partners are exactly the firm's partners` IS FALSE

`a pre-conversion supplier debt` MEANS ConversionDebt WITH
    `the person was a partner of the firm` IS TRUE
    `incurred before conversion` IS TRUE
    `arose from a contract made before conversion` IS FALSE

`rent falling due after conversion under a lease signed before` MEANS ConversionDebt WITH
    `the person was a partner of the firm` IS TRUE
    `incurred before conversion` IS FALSE
    `arose from a contract made before conversion` IS TRUE

`a debt under a contract the LLP made` MEANS ConversionDebt WITH
    `the person was a partner of the firm` IS TRUE
    `incurred before conversion` IS FALSE
    `arose from a contract made before conversion` IS FALSE

`a pre-conversion debt claimed from a new LLP partner` MEANS ConversionDebt WITH
    `the person was a partner of the firm` IS FALSE
    `incurred before conversion` IS TRUE
    `arose from a contract made before conversion` IS TRUE

§ `First Schedule para 2 -- equal shares`

#ASSERT `the number of partners` (LIST `the big contributor`, `the small contributor`) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the number of partners` (LIST `the big contributor`, `the small contributor`, `a third partner with no capital`) EQUALS 3

#ASSERT `the total capital` (LIST `the big contributor`, `the small contributor`) EQUALS 1000000
#ASSERT `the total capital` (LIST `the big contributor`, `the small contributor`, `a third partner with no capital`) EQUALS 1000000

#ASSERT `each partner's share of capital where the agreement is silent` TRUE (LIST `the big contributor`, `the small contributor`) EQUALS 500000

#ASSERT `each partner's default share` 300000 (LIST `the big contributor`, `the small contributor`, `a third partner with no capital`) EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `each partner's default share` 1000 (LIST `the big contributor`, `the small contributor`) EQUALS 500

§ `First Schedule paras 6, 7, 11 -- votes`

#ASSERT `the resolution passes by default` 2 3
#ASSERT NOT `the resolution passes by default` 1 2
#ASSERT NOT `the resolution passes by default` 2 4
#ASSERT `the resolution passes by default` 3 4

#ASSERT `a new partner may be admitted by default` 3 3
#ASSERT NOT `a new partner may be admitted by default` 2 3

#ASSERT NOT `the majority may expel the partner` FALSE 9 10
#ASSERT `the majority may expel the partner` TRUE 6 10
#ASSERT NOT `the majority may expel the partner` TRUE 5 10

§ `First Schedule paras 3, 5, 9, 10`

#ASSERT NOT `the partner is entitled to remuneration` FALSE
#ASSERT `the partner is entitled to remuneration` TRUE

#ASSERT `the LLP must indemnify the partner` `a partner paying a supplier`
#ASSERT `the LLP must indemnify the partner` `a partner paying to repair a burst pipe`
#ASSERT NOT `the LLP must indemnify the partner` `a partner's personal holiday`

#ASSERT `the partner must account to the LLP` `a partner running a rival practice`
#ASSERT `the partner must account to the LLP` `a partner taking a secret commission`
#ASSERT NOT `the partner must account to the LLP` `a partner running a rival practice with consent`
#ASSERT NOT `the partner must account to the LLP` `a partner with an unrelated hobby business`

§ `Second Schedule`

#ASSERT `the firm may convert` `a conversion with the same partners`
#ASSERT NOT `the firm may convert` `a conversion adding a new partner`

#ASSERT `the former firm partner remains personally liable` `a pre-conversion supplier debt`
#ASSERT `the former firm partner remains personally liable` `rent falling due after conversion under a lease signed before`
#ASSERT NOT `the former firm partner remains personally liable` `a debt under a contract the LLP made`
#ASSERT NOT `the former firm partner remains personally liable` `a pre-conversion debt claimed from a new LLP partner`

#ASSERT NOT `invoices must state the conversion` 13
#ASSERT `invoices must state the conversion` 14
#ASSERT `invoices must state the conversion` 378
#ASSERT NOT `invoices must state the conversion` 379

